{
  "sn12.2:0.1": "Linked Discourses 12.2 ",
  "sn12.2:0.2": "1. The Buddhas ",
  "sn12.2:0.3": "Analysis ",
  "sn12.2:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn12.2:1.2": "“Mendicants, I will teach and analyze for you dependent origination. ",
  "sn12.2:1.3": "Listen and apply your mind well, I will speak.” ",
  "sn12.2:1.4": "“Yes, sir,” they replied. ",
  "sn12.2:1.5": "The Buddha said this: ",
  "sn12.2:2.1": "“And what is dependent origination? ",
  "sn12.2:2.2": "Ignorance is a requirement for choices. ",
  "sn12.2:2.3": "Choices are a requirement for consciousness. ",
  "sn12.2:2.4": "Consciousness is a requirement for name and form. ",
  "sn12.2:2.5": "Name and form are requirements for the six sense fields. ",
  "sn12.2:2.6": "The six sense fields are requirements for contact. ",
  "sn12.2:2.7": "Contact is a requirement for feeling. ",
  "sn12.2:2.8": "Feeling is a requirement for craving. ",
  "sn12.2:2.9": "Craving is a requirement for grasping. ",
  "sn12.2:2.10": "Grasping is a requirement for continued existence. ",
  "sn12.2:2.11": "Continued existence is a requirement for rebirth. ",
  "sn12.2:2.12": "Rebirth is a requirement for old age and death, sorrow, lamentation, pain, sadness, and distress to come to be. ",
  "sn12.2:2.13": "That is how this entire mass of suffering originates. ",
  "sn12.2:3.1": "And what is old age and death? ",
  "sn12.2:3.2": "The old age, decrepitude, broken teeth, grey hair, wrinkly skin, diminished vitality, and failing faculties of the various sentient beings in th